@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Instructor MVC dashboard
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/

### Published exams for the mobile client
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/exams
Accept: application/json

### Exam detail
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/exams/c5762312-3f6b-46d0-8f96-4ab270837001
Accept: application/json

### Edit a sample exam in the instructor UI
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/instructor/exams/c5762312-3f6b-46d0-8f96-4ab270837001/edit
